  "route": "original",
  "notes": "Backlog game, all-AAA pass: picked from RAWG's most-added list for its year across all genres (docs/PLAN.md section 2, genre filter widened 2026-10-23). Steam app 371660 (\"Far Cry® Primal\" in the store list, \"Far Cry Primal\" in the schema). None of the 55 Steam achievements is hidden. \"Mark 4 Wenja\" (\"Discover the future past\") is unclear from its text and was put in the exploration chapter with the all-achievements prize; \"Tears of Shame\" (skinning a tamed beast) sits with the beasts. The four Survivor mode achievements are all below 1%. StrategyWiki has no page under \"Far Cry Primal\" or \"Far Cry: Primal\". farcry.fandom.com answers the API under \"Far Cry Primal\" with about 172 linked articles, including a \"Far Cry Primal downloadable content\" page; no Steam achievement names any added content, so there is no DLC chapter. Names only were looked at, nothing copied."
